Sure! Here's the translation of your text into UVL Code:

```uvl
smart_home_autonomy_system_links_devices_based_on_rules

rules {
    trigger {
        alternative {
            movie_mode {
                lights { 10% }
            }
            morning {
                lights { 100% }
            }
        }
        optional {
            condition {
                or {
                    away_status {
                        disable_smart_oven
                    }
                    window_sensor_open {
                        disable_air_conditioner
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }

    priority {
        set "movie_mode" {
            blocks "morning" with_priority { "movie_mode" > "morning" }
        }
        dynamic {
            disable {
                air_conditioner {
                    disable
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
```

This code defines a smart home automation system where rules link devices based on specific criteria. The rules include triggers for different scenes, optional conditions, and actions. It also includes safety constraints by disabling certain actions if specific conditions are met.